  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "47",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 47"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "47",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eshomo Yosef ajing'aki Farao te nkaji, nejoki: “Ore papaai lai o lalashera laainei, tenebo intare enye o nkishu enye o pooki toki naata, eetuo aaing'uaa enkop e Kanaan. Netii taata ninche ina kop e Goshen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neriku too lalashera lenyena ltung'ana imiet arikoki Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Farao ilalashera lenyena. “Ainyoo oshi esaiai inyi niasiasa?” Nejoki ninche Farao, “Ore isinkan linono naa ilaramatak, anaa enatiu apa iloo papa lang.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche Farao, “Kietuo iyiook aamany ena kop, amu meeta indaat oo ntare isinkan linono, amu etaa olameyu sapuk te nkop e Kanaan; naa ore taata, kiomon iyie inchoo isinkan linono emany enkop e Goshen.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee ejoki Farao Yosef, “Eewuo papaai lino o lalashera enitii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neina enkop e Misiri natii dukuya iyie, intamanya papaai lino o lalashera linono ine wueji sidai aisul tena kop, inchoo emany enkop e Goshen naa tiniyiolo iltung'ana airritak supati te ninche tipika ninche meitasheiki inkishu aainei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie eitijing'u Yosef Yakobo papaai lenye neitoton te dukuya Farao, nemayian Yakobo Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Farao Yakobo, “Kaja inkolong'i oo larin le nkishui ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yakobo Farao, “Ore inkolong'i oo larin laainei lenkidurrudur ai naa ilarin iip o tomoni uni; kuti naa torrok inkolong'i oo larin le nkishui ai, neitu ebaiki inkolong'i oo larin le nkishui oo loo papa too nkolong'i enkidurrudur enye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemayian Yakobo Farao nepuku alo aing'uaa Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eitamanya Yosef ilalashera lenyena, neisho ninye ninche enkop metaa enenye te Misiri, ewueji neisul te ina kop e Rameses, anaa enaitanapishe Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisho Yosef papaai lenye, tenebo ilalashera lenyena, o lmarei lenye pooki endaa, terisioroto esiana ooltung'ana lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olameyu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etaa meekure apa eetae endaa teina kop pooki; amu etasapuka olameyu oleng', metaa etaa enkop e Misiri o enkop e Kanaan enaisumash te nkaraki olameyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesotu Yosef impisai pooki naanotoki te nkop e Misiri o te nkop e Kanaan, te ntapa nainyiang'utua; neyau Yosef nena pisai aya enkaji e Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore pee emiri aaishu impisai pooki te nkop e Misiri o te nkop e Kanaan, eetuo Ilmisiri pooki enetii Yosef nejoki ninye, “Inchoo iyiook endaa; ainyoo pee kiye te dukuya nkonyek inyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kiishutua impisai ang'.” Newal Yosef ajo, “Enchoru inkishu inyi, naa kaisho intae endaa awalunye nkishu inyi tenetaa eishunye impisai inyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa nerewaki inkishu enye Yosef; neisho Yosef ninche endaa awalunye imbartan enye, o intare, o nkishu, o sirkon: neisho ninye ninche endaa awalunye nkishu enye pooki teilo ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eishunye ilo ari, neitoki aapuonu to likae ari nejoki ninye, “Mikisudorie ate olkitok lang inchere eishunye impisai ang pooki, ore iluaat oo nkishu naa ino lkitok lang; metii ae toki natung'uayioki te dukuya olkitok lang meteleku iseseni lang ake o enkop ang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainyoo pee kiye te dukuya inkonyek inono, iyiook tenebo enkop ang'? Inyang'u iyiook tenebo enkop ang te ndaa; ore iyiook tenebo enkop ang nikiaku irrindiki le Farao; nincho iyiook ilanterera pee kinchu nimikiye, neaku ena kop pooki mitil.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa einyiang'ua Yosef enkop pooki e Misiri ainyang'aki Farao, amu etimira Ilmisiri inkurman enye amu ketarasua olameyu oleng te ninche. Neaku enkop pooki ene Farao; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore iltung'ana neaku, irrindiki pooki eiteru te nkiting'oto nabo e Misiri o metabaiki enkae kiting'oto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkop ake oo lapolosak eitu einyang'u; amu keeta apa ilapolosak emborei enye nauno naing'uaaa Farao, neishunyie ina borei enye naishoo Farao ninche; metaa eitu ninche emir enkop enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee ejoki Yosef iltung'ana, “Ing'ura ainyiang'ua intae ena olong tenebo enkop inyi aitaa ene Farao. Ore naa, noolo ilanterera linyi, naa entuun enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkata e nkisampuare ninchosho ematua e imiet Farao, ore ematua e ong'uan neaku inkuninyi ilanterera le nkop, neaku sii endaa inyi o lmarei linyi, o ndaiki naanya inkera inyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninche, “Intajeuo enkishui ang; inchoo eitiship ena olkitok lang', aikiaaku iyiook irrindiki le Farao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eitobirua Yosef nkiguanat naaipirta enkop e Misiri, neitashe nena kiguanat o taata, inchere etum Farao ematua e imiet; enkop ake oo lapolosak neitu eaku ene Farao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eomonunoto e Yakobo nabayie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa etamanya Israel Enkop e Misiri ina kop e Goshen; netum imasaa kumok teine, neisho oleng nebul te nkumoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neton Yakobo te nkop e Misiri ilarin tomon o oopishana; metaa ore inkolong'i oo larin le nkishui e Yakobo naa iip o artam oopishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
