        },
        {
          "text": " Ore pee enyiku inkolong'i pee eaku enkata nairura Israel, eipoto olayioni lenye Yosef nejoki ninye, “Tenetaa taata anoto omom too nkonyek inono, tipika enkaina ino abori enkupes ai nikisiligie ajo aikintaas nanu enkanyit o esipata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
